Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> program
Rule 1     program -> statements
Rule 2     statements -> statements statement
Rule 3     statements -> statement
Rule 4     statement -> class_definition
Rule 5     statement -> create_statement
Rule 6     statement -> set_statement
Rule 7     statement -> attach_statement
Rule 8     statement -> repeat_statement
Rule 9     statement -> until_statement
Rule 10    statement -> if_statement
Rule 11    statement -> ask_statement
Rule 12    statement -> say_statement
Rule 13    statement -> call_statement
Rule 14    class_definition -> CLASS IDENTIFIER class_body END CLASS
Rule 15    class_definition -> CLASS IDENTIFIER FROM IDENTIFIER class_body END CLASS
Rule 16    class_definition -> CREATURE IDENTIFIER class_body END CREATURE
Rule 17    class_definition -> CREATURE IDENTIFIER FROM IDENTIFIER class_body END CREATURE
Rule 18    class_body -> class_body class_member
Rule 19    class_body -> class_member
Rule 20    class_member -> constructor
Rule 21    class_member -> method
Rule 22    constructor -> CREATE WITH LPAREN parameters RPAREN statements END CREATE
Rule 23    constructor -> WHEN BORN WITH LPAREN parameters RPAREN statements END BORN
Rule 24    constructor -> WHEN BORN statements END BORN
Rule 25    method -> METHOD IDENTIFIER statements END METHOD
Rule 26    method -> ACTION action_name statements END ACTION
Rule 27    action_name -> IDENTIFIER
Rule 28    action_name -> action_name IDENTIFIER
Rule 29    parameters -> parameters IDENTIFIER
Rule 30    parameters -> IDENTIFIER
Rule 31    create_statement -> CREATE IDENTIFIER IDENTIFIER WITH expression
Rule 32    create_statement -> CREATE IDENTIFIER IDENTIFIER
Rule 33    create_statement -> BRING IDENTIFIER TO LIFE AS IDENTIFIER WITH expression
Rule 34    create_statement -> BRING IDENTIFIER TO LIFE AS IDENTIFIER
Rule 35    set_statement -> SET IDENTIFIER IDENTIFIER TO expression
Rule 36    set_statement -> GIVE IDENTIFIER THE TRAIT IDENTIFIER TO expression
Rule 37    attach_statement -> ATTACH IDENTIFIER TO IDENTIFIER
Rule 38    repeat_statement -> REPEAT NUMBER TIMES statements END REPEAT
Rule 39    until_statement -> UNTIL condition statements END UNTIL
Rule 40    if_statement -> IF condition statements ELSE statements END IF
Rule 41    if_statement -> WHEN condition statements OTHERWISE statements END WHEN
Rule 42    ask_statement -> ASK STRING
Rule 43    say_statement -> SAY expression
Rule 44    call_statement -> CALL IDENTIFIER IDENTIFIER
Rule 45    call_statement -> IDENTIFIER DOES action_name
Rule 46    condition -> IDENTIFIER IDENTIFIER comparison_op expression
Rule 47    comparison_op -> GT
Rule 48    comparison_op -> LT
Rule 49    comparison_op -> EQ
Rule 50    comparison_op -> NEQ
Rule 51    expression_list -> expression_list expression
Rule 52    expression_list -> expression
Rule 53    expression -> STRING
Rule 54    expression -> NUMBER
Rule 55    expression -> IDENTIFIER
Rule 56    expression -> IDENTIFIER IDENTIFIER
Rule 57    expression -> expression PLUS expression
Rule 58    expression -> expression MINUS expression
Rule 59    expression -> LPAREN expression_list RPAREN

